        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="why" value="&lt;b&gt;WHY THIS STRUCTURE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1  Stable graph as tools grow: new APIs join the registry, not the top-level fan-out.    2  Data minimization: full employee facts are retrieved only when required.    3  Consistent controls: every action passes the same authorization and validation gate.    4  Reliable multi-turn actions: clarification and document collection pause and resume through checkpoints.    5  Multi-question support: information and action parts can be processed separately and assembled once." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#F6F8FB;strokeColor=#AEB8C7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#17233F;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
